<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:21px;">You have been invited to {{workspaceName}}</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">{{inviterName}} invited you to join the <strong>{{workspaceName}}</strong> workspace on {{appName}} as <strong>{{role}}</strong>.</p>
{{> button url=inviteUrl label="Accept invitation"}}
<p style="margin:20px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;">This invitation expires in {{expiresIn}}.</p>
